    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel \"not normal\" though. it actually feels like the only math that makes sense. if i'm gone, the debt stops growing for them, they get the life insurance, and they can actually breathe. right now, everything i do just makes the hole deeper. it's like i'm being selfish by staying when i know I'm just making things harder for everyone else.",
